;\">4ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">14ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Archetype Feature</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">15ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.aPOOY7JqLgVOsImh]{Broadened Horizons}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">8</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">4ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">16ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+5</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.izdnt7eqytkwgb1d]{Ability Score Improvement}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">17ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.npW7ZkOmkfqGTwU6]{Arcane Denial}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">9</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">18ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">Archetype Feature</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">19ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.izdnt7eqytkwgb1d]{Ability Score Improvement} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.8RYZWRaK0zy6UyiJ]{Cantrip Mastery}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">11</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td></tr><tr><td style=\"text-align: center;\">20ᵗʰ</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">+6</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.Hz8E9OCOu1enIaQt]{Power Unleashed}</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">10</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">11</td><td style=\"text-align: center;\">5ᵗʰ</td></tr></tbody></table><h3><br>Hit Points</h3><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 1d8 per warcaster level</p><p><strong>Hit Points at 1st Level:</strong> 8 + your Constitution modifier</p><p><strong>Hit Points at Higher Levels:</strong> 1d8 (or 5) + your Constitution modifier per warcaster level after 1st</p><h3>Proficiencies</h3><p><strong>Armor:</strong> Light Armor</p><p><strong>Weapons:</strong> Simple weapons</p><p><strong>Tools:</strong> Artisan’s tools (one set)</p><p><strong>Saving Throws:</strong> Dexterity, Intelligence</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Arcana, choose two from History, Insight, Investigation, Medicine, Sleight of Hand, Stealth, Survival</p><h3>Equipment</h3><p>You start with 100gp which you can spend on your character’s starting weapons, armor, and adventuring gear. You can choose ala carte or take one of the starting packages below:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Studious Caster’s Set (Cost 73 gold):</strong> Dagger, sickle, padded cloth, grimoire arcane focus, scholar’s pack</p></li><li><p><strong>Inconspicuous Traveler’s Set (Cost 49 gold):</strong> Quarterstaff, padded cloth, crystal arcane focus, dice set, explorer’s pack, donkey</p></li><li><p><strong>Battlefield Scout’s Set (Cost 100 gold):</strong> dagger, light crossbow and 20 bolts, padded leather, component pouch, dungeoneer’s pack</p></li></ul>",
